# Context = repo root; only what the services bundle needs (Dockerfile-specific ignore, BuildKit).
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!patches/**
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/**
!services/**
# Workspace members outside the bundle keep their manifests so pnpm sees the same importers as the lockfile.
!apps/*/package.json
!scripts/drive/package.json
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.log
